    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 is the wildest arena shooter out there\u2014and it doesn\u2019t care about limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw yourself into fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled gunfights where chaos reigns, weapons combine in impossible ways, and wins don\u2019t just happen\u2014they create legends. Whether you're an OG pixelgunner or a fresh frag-hunter, there\u2019s something here with your name on it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own insane loadouts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Min-max like a pro, or throw logic out the window and go full wildcard. Either way\u2014you\u2019re dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the arena</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps aren\u2019t just for movement\u2014they\u2019re for mayhem. Use each and every block and pixel to your advantage\u2014or become someone else\u2019s kill count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surf the madness</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore game modes that go way beyond what you'd expect. Think you\u2019ve seen it all? We\u2019ve got a few surprises up our sleeve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill it or chill it</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing sweaty leaderboard spots, reliving that nostalgic PG magic, or just passing time with style\u2014Pixel Gun 2 delivers. If you're having fun, you're doing it right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become part of the legend</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic PG helped define mobile shooters for a generation. Pixel Gun 2 takes all the best from that heritage and turns it up to 200%. You're not just playing\u2014you\u2019re joining a shooter saga. Everyone in Pixel Gun 2 is a sibling-in-arms... until they\u2019re frags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And limits?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah... we respawn past those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is just the beginning! There\u2019s so much more coming to Pixel Gun 2\u2014and you\u2019ll be in the loop every step of the way. The trigger-happy party\u2019s about to go off. You do not wanna miss this.\u00a0<strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p>",
