 it up to 200%. You're not just playing\u2014you\u2019re joining a shooter saga. Everyone in Pixel Gun 2 is a sibling-in-arms... until they\u2019re frags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And limits?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah... we respawn past those.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is just the beginning! There\u2019s so much more coming to Pixel Gun 2\u2014and you\u2019ll be in the loop every step of the way. The trigger-happy party\u2019s about to go off. You do not wanna miss this.\u00a0<strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Say hello to your new favorite arena shooter\u2014Pixel Gun 2! Build insane gun combos, flex your skills, or just surf the chaos. Limits? Nah, we respawn past those. Whatever you're lookin\u2019 for\u2014nostalgia, hardcore competition, pure fun, or just a time-killer\u2014you get it here. Every time. Wishlist now!",
